```mdl
verdict QA-1: An autocue script drives the draw, connect and nest path, but checks none of the expectations.
  status: partial
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-canvas/autocue/draw-and-nest.mjs]
  note: |
    `draw-and-nest.mjs` (tagged `@mdl ... test QA-1`) performs every step and waits for elements to appear, so a
    missing control fails it; it never checks "About counts 4 nodes", links following moved shapes, or the frame
    drawing its nested scene. It is a demo recording, not a CI test. No Playwright spec in
    `composer-app/src/playwright` covers canvas.
```

```mdl
verdict QA-3: An autocue script walks the architecture tour, but asserts none of the stated outcomes.
